Plenty of people call Ethereum Classic “the old Ethereum".. a relic.

It’s really a computer no one owns:

→ Programs, data, and a processor
→ Run by nodes worldwide
→ Powering dApps, smart contracts and is a store-of-value

No company to shut it down. No admin to change the rules.